   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol start=\"1\">\n<li>The number of hours worked, <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>, and the total dollars earned, <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>, have a strong positive relationship.<br><br>\nExplain what it means to have a strong positive relationship in this situation.</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1224301,
     "content_html": "As the number of hours worked increases, the total dollars earned remains unchanged."
    },
    {
     "id": 1224300,
     "content_html": "As the number of hours worked decreases, the total dollars earned increases."
    },
